                134,
                594,
                605,
                615
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A survey of glazing failures due to wind load indicates that improper installation of setting blocks, gaskets, or lateral shims, or poor edge bite is a significant cause of the failures experienced.\n",
